      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-light">
        A focused development track at Drum Sync Academy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <!-- Keep the name "PDI" exactly as given. -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red/50 bg-elevated p-6 text-sm text-gray-light">
      <strong class="text-white">[TODO: confirm what PDI stands for and its full details]</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg text-gray-light">
      <p>
        TODO: placeholder. PDI is a personalized development path designed to
        move you toward specific playing goals with structured, one-on-one
        attention.
      </p>
      <p>
        TODO: placeholder. Describe who PDI is for, how sessions are structured,
        what a typical block looks like, and how progress is tracked.
      </p>
      <p>
